OL,3,GNEWSA'Layers of Roman history' found
OL,4,Aduring renovation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hoard of fragmented Roman artefacts
OL,7,Ffound in Somerset has sparked wonder
OL,8,Famong archaeologists about "the layers
OL,9,Fof history hidden beneath our feet".
OL,11,FExcavations beneath the Bath Assembly
OL,12,FRooms have uncovered a network of Roman
OL,13,Fditches, pottery, coins, glassware, and
OL,14,Fpiece of a military helmet.
OL,16,FExperts said the finds expand the known
OL,17,Fextent of Roman occupation, and suggest
OL,18,Fthat further remains are likely to
OL,19,Fsurvive beneath neighbouring Georgian
OL,20,Fstreets.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
